---
import SocialLink from "@components/SocialLink.astro";
---

<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-label">
  <canvas class="quote" id="quote" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <p class="label fade" id="about-label">About</p>
  <p class="prose" data-reveal>
    You've found my node on the web, where I share <strong>what I build, what I learn and what I'm curious about.</strong>
  </p>
  <p class="prose" data-reveal>
    It all started with machines I wasn't supposed to open. No internet, no manuals, <strong
      >just a screwdriver and a lot of trial and error.</strong
    >
  </p>
  <p class="prose" data-reveal>
    I never stopped. Only the machines changed: <strong>software, then systems, then platforms.</strong> Lately I've been
    drifting toward <strong>solution architecture</strong>, designing how the pieces fit before anyone builds them.
  </p>
  <p class="prose" data-reveal>
    Now I'm building <strong>AI-accelerated workflows and products.</strong> Same curiosity, new machines.
  </p>
  <p class="prose" data-reveal>
    Always up for a good conversation and meeting new people. Find me on <SocialLink
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michaelhuebel/"
      icon="linkedin">LinkedIn</SocialLink
    > or <SocialLink href="https://github.com/visua1hue" icon="github">GitHub</SocialLink>.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    --pad-top: clamp(64px, 9vw, 104px);
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: var(--pad-top) 24px clamp(96px, 12vw, 144px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .about > :not(.quote) {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .label {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* Dithered quotation mark drawn by scripts/about/quote.ts */
  .quote {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    top: calc(var(--pad-top) + 30px);
    left: clamp(-96px, -6vw, 4px);
    width: clamp(120px, 15vw, 190px);
    height: clamp(100px, 12.5vw, 158px);
    pointer-events: none;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 1.2s ease;
  }

  .quote:global(.in) {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .prose {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2.6vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.38;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .prose strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-fg);
  }

  /* Words are wrapped at runtime by scripts/about/reveal.ts */
  .prose :global(.w) {
    opacity: 0.16;
    transition: opacity 0.25s linear;
  }

  .fade {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.8s ease,
      transform 0.8s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .fade:global(.in) {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .prose :global(.w) {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .fade {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { drawQuote } from "@scripts/about/quote";
  import { initReveal } from "@scripts/about/reveal";

  const quote = document.getElementById("quote") as HTMLCanvasElement | null;
  if (quote) drawQuote(quote);
  initReveal(document.getElementById("about"));
</script>
